    {
      "id": "9613164f6b109deae1752ff5313d2245a344f88b",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1975671532,
          "type": null,
          "body": "In this mate config example there's a typo on line 15; the ';' token is missing after the 'Done':\n\n```\n% cat -n frame_time.mate\n     1\t// comment\n     2\t// comment\n     3\t// comment\n     4\t// comment\n     5\t\n     6\tPdu frame_pdu Proto frame Transport mate {\t// comment\n     7\t    Extract frame_time From frame.time;\t\t// comment\n     8\t};\t\t\t\t\t\t// comment\n     9\t\n    10\tGop frame_gop On frame_pdu Match (frame_time) { // comment\n    11\t    Start (frame_time);\t\t\t\t// comment\n    12\t    Stop (frame_time=\"FOO\");\t\t\t// comment\n    13\t};\t\t\t\t\t\t// comment\n    14\t\n    15\tDone\t\t\t\t\t\t// comment\n```\n\nBefore this MR we see this syntax error:\n\n```\n% tshark -C 'Mate Focused' -r chargen.pcap -o mate.config:frame_time.mate -q\ntshark: MATE failed to configure!\nIt is recommended that you fix your config and restart Wireshark.\nThe reported error is:\n frame_time.mate at line 4: Syntax Error before (null)\n\n\n% \n```\n\nNotice that the user is directed to look at line 4 before the token \"(null)\".\n\nWith MR applied we see this:\n\n```\n% tshark -C 'Mate Focused' -r chargen.pcap -o mate.config:frame_time.mate -q\ntshark: MATE failed to configure!\nIt is recommended that you fix your config and restart Wireshark.\nThe reported error is:\n /Users/jyoung/projects/MATE/frame_time.mate at line 16: Syntax error detected before end of file.\n\n\n%\n```\n\nThere's room for future improvements. Specifically under certain cases tokens are silently echoed to stdout.",
